            array('id' => '14','key' => 'overview-section','value' => '{"language":{"en":{"section_title":"Overview","heading":"Discover the Long-Term Strength of Gold Investments","sub_heading":"Expert guidance and comprehensive resources to help you make gold investments that last and thrive over time.","description":"At GoldInvest, we recognize gold as the cornerstone of a secure financial future. For centuries, gold has been a reliable store of wealth, providing stability and acting as a hedge against inflation and economic downturns.","button_name":"Invest Now"},"es":{"section_title":"Descripci\\u00f3n general","heading":"Descubra la solidez a largo plazo de las inversiones en oro","sub_heading":"Orientaci\\u00f3n experta y recursos integrales para ayudarle a realizar inversiones en oro que duren y prosperen en el tiempo.","description":"En GoldInvest, reconocemos que el oro es la piedra angular de un futuro financiero seguro. Durante siglos, el oro ha sido una reserva confiable de riqueza, brindando estabilidad y actuando como cobertura contra la inflaci\\u00f3n y las crisis econ\\u00f3micas.","button_name":"Invierta ahora"},"ar":{"section_title":"\\u0645\\u0644\\u062e\\u0635","heading":"\\u0627\\u0643\\u062a\\u0634\\u0641 \\u0642\\u0648\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062b\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u0647\\u0628 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062f\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644","sub_heading":"\\u0625\\u0631\\u0634\\u0627\\u062f\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u0628\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0648\\u0645\\u0648\\u0627\\u0631\\u062f \\u0634\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u0627\\u0639\\u062f\\u062a\\u0643 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0642\\u064a\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u062b\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0630\\u0647\\u0628\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062a\\u062f\\u0648\\u0645 \\u0648\\u062a\\u0632\\u062f\\u0647\\u0631 \\u0628\\u0645\\u